      "filename": "Captain Christopher Burns with the 1ST Reconnaissance Squadron is prepped for his first solo high-altitude flight by squadron aerospace physiologists before starting engines. AIRMAN - DPLA - e6db7d16a678bb68038a037ab29d58a9.jpeg",
      "title": "File:Captain Christopher Burns with the 1ST Reconnaissance Squadron is prepped for his first solo high-altitude flight by squadron aerospace physiologists before starting engines. AIRMAN - DPLA - e6db7d16a678bb68038a037ab29d58a9.jpeg",
